; Mini-FAT for a Z80-class target (TYPE=z80). The core is one module.
; Each f_* object is linked only when the program calls that symbol.
; 8085 lists the same calls in minifat_8085.lst.
; 8080 lists the same calls in minifat_8080.lst.
; gbz80 lists the same calls in minifat_gbz80.lst.
; vm1 lists the same calls in minifat_vm1.lst.
